From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Giga Edge SDK <noreply@giga-edge-sdk.invalid>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:31:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] gpt-4o pre-tokenizer: a custom split and pruned
 vocabulary hashes

A hand-written split for the GPT-4o pre-tokenizer regex, about 12 times
faster than the std::regex path; test-unicode-gpt4o compares it with
std::regex. The converter maps two tokenizers with a vocabulary pruned to
8448 tokens to the gpt-4o pre-tokenizer.
---
